  <div class="meta">Last updated: 11 October 2026</div>

  <p>These terms cover your use of ReviewReply, its paid plans and its browser extension. By using the site or the extension, you agree to them.</p>

  <h2>Who we are</h2>
  <p>ReviewReply (www.reviewreply.store) is run by Peak Apps Studio. You can reach us at <a href="mailto:info@peakappsstudio.com">info@peakappsstudio.com</a>. ReviewReply is an independent tool and is not affiliated with Google.</p>

  <h2>What the site does</h2>
  <p>You paste a customer review and choose a tone, and ReviewReply writes a draft reply with an AI model, in the language of the review. The site also has reply guides and templates.</p>

  <h2>Check every reply before you post it</h2>
  <p>A generated reply is a draft. Read it before you post it, add the names, fixes and contact details that are true for your business, and remove anything that is not. You are responsible for what you post. Make sure your replies follow Google's review policies and privacy law: for example, a healthcare business must not confirm that a reviewer is a patient. Our guides are general information, not legal advice.</p>

